@startuml bike_repair
|customer|
start
:a · bring the bike to the shop;
|mechanic|
:b · look at the bike · write the quote;
|customer|
if (c · accept the quote?) then (yes)
  |mechanic|
  repeat
    :d · repair one part;
  backward :e · order the missing part · wait for it;
  repeat while (f · every part fixed?) is (no) not (yes)
  :g · test ride;
  |customer|
  :h · pick up the bike · pay;
else (no)
  :i · take the bike home;
  end
endif
stop
@enduml
